-- The file imported here is refused if an input named like a mixfix word, in a
-- rule under a `§`, is passed on to another rule (smucclaw/l4-ide#1076). The
-- importer then reported #1025's internal error for every name it imported,
-- including the ones whose own definitions were accepted.
IMPORT `mixfix-input-word-argument-def`

#ASSERT `inc` 5 EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `twice` 5 EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the day` 3 `days before` 10 EQUALS 7
